# Unreal: generated folders are never committed.
Signal47/Binaries/
Signal47/Intermediate/
Signal47/Saved/
Signal47/DerivedDataCache/
Signal47/.vscode/
Signal47/*.code-workspace
# Bought models and sounds, and all audio (big, rebuilt by the import scripts): never in the public repo.
Signal47/Content/Licensed/
# Selected local Fab dependencies retain their original package paths during migration.
# Recipes/provenance belong in Tools/routenature; vendor binaries never enter this public repo.
Signal47/Content/Northwood/
Signal47/Content/JustBStudios/
Signal47/Content/Audio/
# The free models (CC BY and CC0, ~/Assets/signal47-free), rebuilt by Tools/freemodels/import_free.sh.
Signal47/Content/Free/
# The web game's scene, rebuilt by Tools/webexport (export.py then import_web.py); holds the bought models too.
Signal47/Content/Web/
Signal47/Content/WebData/
